<v Jad Abumrad>And Charles, himself, first bumped into the tale in this really old, obscure memoir.
<v Jad Abumrad>查尔斯本人也是在一本非常古老、鲜为人知的回忆录中偶然发现了这个故事。

00:26:41.550 --> 00:26:42.510
<v Charles Siebert>Long out of print.
<v Charles Siebert>早就绝版了。

00:26:42.510 --> 00:26:43.240
<v Jad Abumrad>Yeah, what's the name of the book?
<v Jad Abumrad>是的，那本书的名字是什么？

