<v Jad Abumrad>Really?
<v Jad Abumrad>真的吗？

00:31:30.960 --> 00:31:31.620
<v Roger Fouts>Yes.
<v Roger Fouts>是的。

00:31:31.620 --> 00:31:37.340
<v Jad Abumrad>And lying we should also say is another one of those things that people used to think only we do.
<v Jad Abumrad>我们应该说，撒谎也是人们过去认为只有我们人类才会做的事情之一。

