00:57:06.270 --> 00:57:17.650
<v David Hill>I don't know. Normally, I understand why I'm somewhere. I know why. But I guess I don't know, I don't know why I'm here.
<v David Hill>我不知道。通常我知道自己为什么会在某个地方。我知道原因。但我猜我不知道，我不知道我为什么会在这儿。

00:57:17.650 --> 00:57:22.650
